{"title":"Rime Shard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Rime Elemental that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around -145, -1152</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around -145, -1139</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rime-shard\" data-map-level=\"61\">Show level 61 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2760.5px,1773.4px)\"><i style=\"left:2786.0px;top:-1782.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2750.3px;top:-1764.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2772.0px;top:-1783.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2733.5px;top:-1764.4px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -143, -1147 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rime-shard\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rime Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/rime-elemental\">Rime Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden\">Glacier Warden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rime-warden-lord\">Warden Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/d162ff336271d5672347.svg\" alt=\"Rime Shard\"></div><h3>Rime Shard</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 61)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rime Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></articl